            "postlude-ios-membership-terms|manual|text|8": {
              "sourceText": "购买确认后，费用将从您的 App Store 账户中收取。除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时关闭自动续订，否则订阅将自动续期。在当前周期结束前的 24 小时内，您的账户将按相同金额收取续期费用。订阅可在购买后通过 iTunes Store 中的设置进行管理，并可关闭自动续订。欲了解更多信息，请访问我们的《服务条款》和《隐私政策》。",
              "translation": "After you confirm your purchase, the charge will be made to your App Store account. Unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period, your subscription will renew automatically. Within 24 hours before the current period ends, your account will be charged the renewal fee at the same amount. You can manage your subscription and turn off auto-renewal in your iTunes Store settings after purchase. For more information, please see our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy."
            },
